WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.901
This query extracts several components from
admission timestamps YEAR

00:00:05.914 --> 00:00:11.884
and MONTH are straightforward DOW gives PostgreSQL's
numeric day-of-week

00:00:11.910 --> 00:00:18.674
representation HOUR gives the clock-hour component
These

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:23.503
values are useful as analytical features but they do
not preserve the full timestamp or

00:00:23.529 --> 00:00:25.240
create a time bucket on their own
